---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About AI Tool Hub" description="Why we built AI Tool Hub, how we test AI tools, and who we are.">
  <article class="content-page">
    <h1>About AI Tool Hub</h1>
    <p>AI Tool Hub is a curated directory of AI tools we have personally tested. We are not a list of every AI tool that exists — we only list the ones we have used for 2+ weeks and would recommend.</p>

    <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
    <p>AI Tool Hub is run by a small team of writers, developers and designers who use AI tools daily for work. We started this site because the existing AI tool directories were either (a) pay-to-play, (b) full of low-quality tools, or (c) obviously AI-generated without any real testing. We wanted a place that said "we used this, here is what we actually think".</p>

    <h2>How we test</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Sign up</strong> using a fresh account, never a paid promotion.</li>
      <li><strong>Use the tool for 2+ weeks</strong> on real tasks in our actual work (writing, coding, designing).</li>
      <li><strong>Score</strong> on output quality, ease of use, pricing transparency, support quality, and privacy.</li>
      <li><strong>Write a review</strong> with the pros, cons, and a clear "best for" use case.</li>
      <li><strong>Re-test every 6 months</strong> — if a tool drops in quality, we drop it from the list.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What we never do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We never accept payment to include a tool in our rankings.</li>
      <li>We never promote a tool we have not personally tested.</li>
      <li>We never use AI to generate our reviews without a real human testing the tool first.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>AI Tool Hub is supported by display advertising (Google AdSense) and a small number of clearly marked affiliate links. Affiliate links never affect our rankings — if a tool pays us more, it does not rank higher. Each review page has a "Visit Tool" link that goes to the tool's official website. If you sign up, we may earn a commission, at no cost to you.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Found a tool we missed? Found an error? <a href="/contact.html">Get in touch</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
